---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Lede from '../components/ui/Lede.astro';
import Guide from '../components/reading/Guide.astro';
import Outcomes from '../components/reading/Outcomes.astro';
import T from '../components/ui/T.astro';
import {GH, url} from '../lib/sitemap';
---
<Base file="index.html" title="wand125 Square Packing">
<Lede en="Research themes and results on packing unit squares, mainly by wand125. The proofs are published on GitHub." ja="主に wand125 による、単位正方形の詰め込みの研究テーマと成果。証明は GitHub で公開している。">
<div class="intro"><p><span data-l="en">Research themes and results on packing unit squares, mainly by wand125. Most of them are proofs of optimal values and lower bounds, in squares and in other containers (triangles, a regular hexagon, rectangles); the proofs are published on <a href={GH}>GitHub</a>.</span><span data-l="ja">主に wand125 による、単位正方形の詰め込みの研究テーマと成果をまとめたページ。主に最適値と下界の証明で、容器は正方形のほか三角形・正六角形・長方形。証明は <a href={GH}>GitHub</a> で公開している。</span></p>
<p><T en="For the best known packings, and for solved and open problems, see also:" ja="既知最良の詰め方や、解決済み・未解決の取り組みは、以下も参考になる。"/></p><ul class="tight"><li><a href="https://jlevy.github.io/squares/">The Squares Project</a> (jlevy)</li><li><a href="https://evand.github.io/square-packing/">Square Packing Atlas</a> (evand)</li><li><a href="https://erich-friedman.github.io/packing/">Packing Center</a> (Erich Friedman)</li></ul></div>
</Lede>
<h2 class="top-h"><a href={url('guide.html')}><T en="Visualize" ja="ビジュアライズ"/></a></h2><Guide/>
<h2 class="top-h"><a href={url('outcomes.html')}><T en="Outcomes" ja="成果"/></a></h2><Outcomes/>
</Base>
